# A probe of an index over one constructor reads that index and the heaps its fetch walks.
use planner

probe plan
  explain from i in identities.Google where i.gid == "root" select key i
----
Set total
  reads identities.EmailPass, identities.Google, identities.Apple, identities (gid)
  Pipeline
    One row
    Probe identities (gid)
      pruned EmailPass at compile, Apple at compile
      Google ->
        Chain
          Emit
